  "description": "Seol-jong Kim is a first-year resident in the Department of Internal Medicine at Sain University Hospital. She has the looks of a celebrity but the personality of a shameless troublemaker.\n\nKyung-jin Park, known as the “madman of internal medicine,” is the department’s chief resident and Seol-jong’s fiercest rival. He’s cool-headed and deeply committed to his work. Though Seol-jong constantly gets in his way, he finds himself unexpectedly drawn to her.\n\nJun-woo Park, the chief resident of the Department of Cosmetic Surgery, is the lucky man who captures Seol-jong’s heart with his charm and confidence.\n\nSet within the bustling halls of Sain University Hospital, this webtoon tells a tangled love story — where rivalry and attraction collide, and a love triangle unfolds in the most unexpected of ways.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63109351), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EA%B7%B8%EB%85%80%EC%9D%98-%EC%A0%95%EC%8B%A0%EC%84%B8%EA%B3%84/3828)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://www.webnovel.com/comic/the-psychological-world-of-her_32101851500507001), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/171849)",
